 lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90622\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>危<rp>(</rp><rt>あや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うく<ruby>溺<rp>(</rp><rt>おぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるところだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她差点就溺水了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8703962\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おまえ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">你；（神灵、贵人等）面前；御前</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226919\">お<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>娘<rp>(</rp><rt>むすめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>夫<rp>(</rp><rt>おっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">让你成为女儿的丈夫。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おめでとう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恭喜；祝贺；恭喜恭喜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225482\">クリスマスおめでとうございます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">祝你圣诞节快乐。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/425680\" title=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お目に掛かる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おめにかかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=